> > I'm installing Tru64 V5.1A on an AlphaServer 300 system. The base OS
> > runs flawlessly and both IP and LAT are running. The next step is to
> > install DECnet (OSI, preferably phase IV).
> > The questions are: where do I find the kit(s) and how does one start
